{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166930-inanimae-and-treasures","id":1166930,"title":"Inanimae and Treasures?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-12T00:44:20-08:00","id":1166930,"title":"Inanimae and Treasures?","content":"Hello then, I recently thought about it after talking with a friend. Inanimae being elementally tied beings and all that with their special form of magic, do they produce treasures? Do they contain Slivers or Arts? Can Kithains use such Treasures?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-19T00:49:15-08:00","id":1168736,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Freederp92</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1166930-inanimae-and-treasures#post1166930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hello then, I recently thought about it after talking with a friend. Inanimae being elementally tied beings and all that with their special form of magic, do they produce treasures? Do they contain Slivers or Arts? Can Kithains use such Treasures?</div> </div> </div> </div>Used no reason why they wouldn't produce treasures. However since Slivers are only used in Unleashings (something no Treasure should be able to do) , I would assume they use arts, or even that weird stuff the Hsien do to model the effects of said treasures.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T05:32:21-08:00","id":1170148,"title":"","content":"Slivers can only be Unleashed because of space considerations. I think we'll see proper level powers for Slivers in future sourcebooks. Until then, I'd model Inanimae Treasures with Kithain Arts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T13:49:06-08:00","id":1170272,"title":"","content":"All right, it was something I was curious about especially since how focused their own Slivers are. My group has unknowingly been aiding two different Inanimae in cleaning their respective autumn world counterparts, one a cavern and another a secluded campsite since something has begun to defile other wild places of magic. So I've been trying to figure out how to create a 'gift' for each of them to the group.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11808-freederp92","name":"Freederp92","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}